<title>USA: U.S. lead stocks up in December - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. lead stocks up in December - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead stocks held by U.S. refiners rose to 8,994 short tons at the end of December from 8,633 short tons at the end of November, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics..</p>
<p>Production of lead fell to 28,065 short tons in the month from 28,817 short tons in November.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants fell to 27,568 short tons in December from 28,075 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
